OMINIS-2.0 MODEL

The ominis-2.0 model is the first Mexican LLM specialized in health,
developed for clinical, epidemiological, and administrative health research.

Model specifications:
- 7 billion parameters
- 32,768 token context window
- Trained on 33+ million medical documents
- 1,400+ human-curated sources (IMSS, ISSSTE, Tainacan)

